<title>UK: London precious metals finish quietly easier.</title>
<headline>London precious metals finish quietly easier.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Closed at $324.50/$325.00 vs $327.80/$328.30 previously. Not much momentum all day. Marked time after Comex opened head of Greenspan testimony. In range.</p>
<p>SILVER - Ended at $4.31/$4.33 down five cents. Little movement all day.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Finished at $416.00/$419.00, down $1.50.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Ended at $196.40/$199.40, down $2.10.</p>
</text>
